===Etymology===
From {{term|Antichrist}}, but later reinforced and influenced by {{prefix|anti|Christian}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{a|UK}} {{IPA|/antɪˈkɹɪstɪən/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Pertaining to [[Antichrist]].
#*'''1644''', {{w|John Milton}}, ''Aeropagitica'':
